DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45199::$$$message_0410_0000_0000$$$::"Here goes...! Feuer!"[wvs]::
45200::$$$message_0410_0000_0001$$$::"The bullets are too big. Illya, at your current output, you should focus your magical energy more."::
45201::$$$message_0410_0000_0002$$$::"..."::
45202::$$$message_0410_0000_0003$$$::"Okay! [wvl][hffgchg2 chara=イリヤpzm face=真剣 pos=left time=300]Um... I'll imagine it and...Feuer!"[wvs]::
45203::$$$message_0410_0000_0004$$$::"That's much better. Next, try to imagine rotating it to give it more penetrative power..."::
45204::$$$message_0410_0000_0005$$$::"...Hey."::
45205::$$$message_0410_0000_0006$$$::"You want me to rotate it? Right or left?"::
45206::$$$message_0410_0000_0007$$$::"Either way works, but the rotational axis should follow the trajectory of fire..."::
45207::$$$message_0410_0000_0008$$$::"Hey!"::
45208::$$$message_0410_0000_0009$$$::"Hm? What is it, Chloe?"::
45209::$$$message_0410_0000_0010$$$::"Do you have an opinion to add about Illya developing new combat techniques?"::
45210::$$$message_0410_0000_0011$$$::"I'm not interested in her puny little tricks. More importantly, isn't something wrong!?"::
45211::$$$message_0410_0000_0012$$$::"Nothing's wrong."::
45212::$$$message_0410_0000_0013$$$::"Nothing's wrong."::
45213::$$$message_0410_0000_0014$$$::"Don't just parrot that at me![wait time=400 canskip=0] [hfwww layer=2]This is obviously off! Hurry up and realize it, you two!"::
45214::$$$message_0410_0000_0015$$$::"Well..."::
45215::$$$message_0410_0000_0016$$$::"...Um. I noticed this morning, but I've been pretending not to. You mean...the colors?"::
45216::$$$message_0410_0000_0017$$$::"You were [font italic=true]pretending[font italic=false]!?"::
45217::$$$message_0410_0000_0018$$$::"Also my voice is...how do I put it, it transcends language."::
45218::$$$message_0410_0000_0019$$$::"Yeah! I don't know why, but my voice and color are gone![wait time=400 canskip=0] [hfwww layer=2]I don't get it! What's happening!? Is this a glitch!?"::
45219::$$$message_0410_0000_0020$$$::"Urgh, all I hear is just 'popopopo,' but I can understand what you're saying... It feels gross..."::
45220::$$$message_0410_0000_0021$$$::"...Is your existence becoming unstable again due to a lack of magical energy?"::
45221::$$$message_0410_0000_0022$$$::"Well, that's the first thing I considered. ...Oh, well. I didn't want to do this, but I guess I gotta."::
45222::$$$message_0410_0000_0023$$$::"Huh? Why are you gripping my shoulder so tightly, Chloe? [wvl][hffgchg2 chara=イリヤpzm face=驚き2 pos=left time=300][hfangry layer=0]Why are you closing in on me with that dazed look!?"::
45223::$$$message_0410_0000_0024$$$::"Thanks for the meal..."::
45224::$$$message_0410_0000_0025$$$::"...Mm, that's rich."::
45225::$$$message_0410_0000_0026$$$::"Haah, haah...! Th-that was awful! You stole a pure maiden's lips by force again!"::
45226::$$$message_0410_0000_0027$$$::"Phew. I don't take magical energy this way because I enjoy it, you know. If you don't like it, then take it up with whoever wrote my backstory."::
45227::$$$message_0410_0000_0028$$$::"But Chloe..."::
45228::$$$message_0410_0000_0029$$$::"Looks like...it didn't work. I already had enough power, so I assumed it wouldn't."::
45229::$$$message_0410_0000_0030$$$::"You kissed me when you thought it wouldn't help!?"::
45230::$$$message_0410_0000_0031$$$::"...So what now? I can't think of any cause or cure for this bizarre condition."::
45231::$$$message_0410_0000_0032$$$::"Bizarre, indeed...[wait time=400 canskip=0][se storage=se04015.wav] Perhaps it requires an equally extraordinary treatment."::
45232::$$$message_0410_0000_0033$$$::"Um, what's that envelope? ...An invitation?"::
45233::$$$message_0410_0000_0034$$$::"It's an invitation to an onsen that came this morning. Apparently, it's a magical hot spring that grants wishes."::
45234::$$$message_0410_0000_0035$$$::"A magical onsen...?"::
45235::$$$message_0410_0000_0036$$$::"That's so sketchy... It doesn't even list the sender... [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=イリヤpzm face=驚き pos=left time=300][hfchance layer=0]Whoa, this was postmarked 10 years ago!"::
45236::$$$message_0410_0000_0037$$$::"Looks credible."::
45237::$$$message_0410_0000_0038$$$::"In what way!?"::
45238::$$$message_0410_0000_0039$$$::"Anyway! Let's go to the onsen! So I can get my voice and color back!"::v�